            "book-text": "A Love for Food and Family When my daughter Oaklee began her solids journey at 6 months, her instant love for food reminded me of my own childhood memories of helping my mum cook. Living in a small home meant I needed a solution that was both slimline and multi-use—so I could include Oaklee in meal times without cluttering our kitchen with multiple baby products",
