        "book_page_YaGVbH": {
          "type": "book-page",
          "settings": {
            "chapter-heading": "",
            "book-text": "Space, Style, and Inclusion I searched for a high chair that would grow with my daughter and allow her to join in our family meals. I followed the baby-led weaning philosophy, always giving Oaklee the same delicious, nutritious meals as the rest of the family. Unfortunately, I couldn’t find a product in the Australian market that met these needs, especially one that was compact enough for a small home.",
